atoes.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-15405-step-0-3" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Using a potato masher (or a fork), mash the potatoes. Taste for seasoning and add in if necessary.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="267" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/quick-mashed-sweet-potatoes-400x267.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Person mashing sweet potatoes with a potato masher." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/quick-mashed-sweet-potatoes-400x267.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/quick-mashed-sweet-potatoes-768x512.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/quick-mashed-sweet-potatoes-150x100.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/quick-mashed-sweet-potatoes.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/quick-mashed-sweet-potatoes.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-15405-step-0-4" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Place in a bowl or a plate (like I did) and garnish with pecans and/or butter.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="267" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Sweet-mashed-potatoes-400x267.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Mashed sweet potatoes in a bowl garnished with butter, thyme, and pecans." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Sweet-mashed-potatoes-400x267.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Sweet-mashed-potatoes-768x512.jpg 768w,